  "ingredients": [
    "1 (12 ounce) package jumbo pasta shells",
    "1 (32 ounce) container ricotta cheese",
    "1 pound shredded mozzarella cheese, divided",
    "8 ounces grated Parmesan cheese, divided",
    "2 large eggs, beaten",
    "1 tablespoon dried parsley",
    "1 teaspoon salt, or more to taste",
    "1 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1 (28 ounce) jar pasta sauce",
    "8 ounces sliced fresh mushrooms"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add pasta and cook until tender yet firm to the bite, 8 to 10 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-4m3KNdqbsB7VYB87JkaOIs1Cds=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21532-StuffedShellsIII-mfs-Step1-0434-94a25a95986a4374a4707c80a23d780b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21532/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the pasta is cooking, mix ricotta cheese, 1/2 of the mozzarella cheese, 1/2 of the Parmesan cheese, eggs, parsley, salt, and pepper in a large bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HANebqKfOodAVNaLDbi0JLcHsoc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21532-StuffedShellsIII-Step2-msf-0448-41d5f0ec9da948089988bfa31aaca12b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21532/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine pasta sauce and mushrooms in a medium bowl. Add remaining mozzarella and Parmesan cheeses; stir until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RrTbkYmYTTivjMNg8D3JrnyBy2w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21532-StuffedShellsIII-msf-Step3-0458-6ce27ba1e85441fa935ceb0d9aa6a1a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21532/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stuff shells with ricotta mixture and place in a 9x13-inch baking dish. Pour pasta sauce mixture over the shells.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LDrWQ9-N6P_bhqgtrBz_lFnmUKY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21532-StuffedShellsIII-msf-Step3-0453-3a4f36816e504a3383625e7e0b9418e6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21532/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until edges are bubbly and the shells are slightly set, 35 to 60 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pdp8aig9pIHS20WAOlBY4hKKC6U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21532-stuffed-shells-iii-DDMFS-4x3-b97c740fa77b41c3af3210aab80f94c6.jpg"
      ],
